---
title: Sequence Diagram — Check-in with the signed QR code (verification token)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Hotel staff (admin)
    participant W as Check-in page (React)
    participant P as protect + authorize('admin')
    participant C as controllers/bookings
    participant T as utils/checkinToken
    participant B as Booking model
    participant A as AuditLog

    Note over S,W: the guest shows the QR from the confirmation email:<br/>HB1.<bookingId>.<paymentRef>.<HMAC-SHA256 signature>
    S->>W: scan / paste the check-in code
    W->>P: POST /api/v1/bookings/checkin {token}
    alt not an admin
        P-->>W: 403 Forbidden
    end
    P->>C: checkIn(req, res)
    C->>T: verifyCheckinToken(token)
    T->>T: recompute HMAC with CHECKIN_TOKEN_SECRET, timingSafeEqual
    alt forged, edited or signed with another key
        T-->>C: null
        C-->>W: 400 {valid: false} "Invalid check-in code"
    end
    T-->>C: {bookingId, reference}
    C->>B: findOne({_id: bookingId, deletedAt: null})
    alt booking cancelled / not found
        C-->>W: 404 {valid: false}
    else not paid, or payment reference changed (payment undone)
        C-->>W: 409 {valid: false} "code no longer valid"
    end
    C->>B: findOneAndUpdate({status: paid, payment.reference, checkedInAt: null} → {checkedInAt: now})
    Note over C,B: atomic: only the first scan succeeds
    alt already checked in
        C-->>W: 409 {valid: true, alreadyCheckedIn: true}
    end
    C->>A: audit(staff, 'booking.checkin')
    C-->>W: 200 {valid: true, guest, hotel, dates, amount, checkedInAt}
    W-->>S: green "guest checked in" card
